    "sentence_translations": [
      "At what age do you want to get married?",
      "",
      "At what age are you able to get married in your country?",
      "In China, men have to be 22 or older, and women 20 or older to get married.",
      "But at this year's national NPC and CPPCC sessions, someone proposed to lower the age to 18.",
      "",
      "This stirred a heated debate in the entire society, and most people do not support lowering the age for marriage.",
      "They believe that 18 years old is too early, and many 18 year olds do not know clearly what kind of life they want.",
      "Even if they got married, the risk of getting divorced in the future would be high.",
      "And at 18 you're still in school and do not have the financial ability.",
      "Some people also believe that lowering the marriageable age is useless.",
      "Those who don't want to get married won't get married anyway.",
      ""
    ]
